OL,3,GNEWSAPip claimants call for fair       
OL,4,Achanges to assessment process          
OL,6,FAfter a review of the disability       
OL,7,Fbenefit scheme recommended an overhaul 
OL,8,Fof the system, some people say that    
OL,9,Fwhile it may appear "great in theory", 
OL,10,Fthey worry it won't be acted on.       
OL,12,FDee Smith, from Stocksbridge near      
OL,13,FSheffield, claims the Personal         
OL,14,FIndependence Payment (Pip), a benefit  
OL,15,Fwhich is given to four million people  
OL,16,Fwhether or not they are in work, to    
OL,17,Fassist with the additional costs of a  
OL,18,Fdisability.                            
OL,20,FThe Timms review proposes both short-  
OL,21,Fand long-term changes to the Pip for   
OL,22,Fclaimants in England and Wales.        
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
