OL,3,GNEWSAPip claimants call for fair       
OL,4,Achanges to assessment process          
OL,6,FSmith, 29, has Friedrich's Ataxia, a   
OL,7,Fdegenerative condition that affects her
OL,8,Fmuscle strength and heart, as well as  
OL,9,Fher co-ordination and speech.          
